{
  "case": "G030",
  "question": "按T/CECS 1764，采用特征因子法计算旱天入流入渗量BI的公式是什么？式中ADF、Cw、C、Cws含义是什么？",
  "expected_answerability": "answer",
  "request_id": "diagnostic-e2e-20261024-ed28-G030",
  "trace_missing": false,
  "wall_ms": 7222.025,
  "http_status": 200,
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-1",
        "text": "按《城镇污水管网入流入渗监测与评估标准》T/CECS 1764-2024 第5.2.3条，采用特征因子法计算旱天入流入渗量时，公式如下：",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_b35f02b4eaf2c6cd8fd2293a8a79c3a7",
          "chunk_17ab47c7825d20d7526ee5779e0c4419"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-2",
        "text": "\n\nBI = ADF × (C_w - C) / (C_w - C_ws)\n\n式中各变量含义：\n- BI——旱天入流入渗量（m³/d）；",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_b35f02b4eaf2c6cd8fd2293a8a79c3a7"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-3",
        "text": "\n- ADF——旱天日均流量监测值（m³/d）；",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_b35f02b4eaf2c6cd8fd2293a8a79c3a7"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-4",
        "text": "\n- C_w——片区污水的典型污染物浓度监测值（kg/m³）；",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_5fc5a585f895d2a66a8b946c5efacf3d"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-5",
        "text": "\n- C——监测点污染物浓度监测值（kg/m³）；",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_decdb577f733b47a160f5f6e2d9319d6"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-6",
        "text": "\n- C_ws——片区外水的典型污染物浓度监测值（kg/m³）。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_56739fd984c8378233a23ecf787f48fa"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
    "conflicts": []
  },
